'''Pokémon: Eevee & Friends''' (Japanese: '''ピカチュウとイーブイ☆フレンズ''' ''Pikachu and {{tt|Eievui|Eevee}} Friends'') is the 25th [[Pikachu short]] of the [[Pokémon animated series]]. It debuted alongside ''[[M16|Genesect and the Legend Awakened]]'' and was made available for the English audience starting on December 6, 2013 through [[Pokémon TV]] on [[Pokémon.com|the official Pokémon website]].
